@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Grievance Officer & Legal Escalation Contact";
}

<section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
        <div class="legal-header">
            <div class="hero-tag">
                <span class="badge-tag badge-tag">⚖️ Compliance &amp; Grievance</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="legal-title">Grievance &amp; Compliance Office</h1>
            <div class="legal-meta">
                <span>Statutory Compliance &bull; Formal Escalation Channel</span>
                <span>Last Updated: August 31, 2026</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-content">
            <div class="highlight-box">
                <strong>Direct Redressal Mechanism:</strong> Stream Helper maintains a designated Grievance and Compliance Office to resolve user complaints, legal inquiries, and rights-holder notices in an expeditious and transparent manner.
            </div>

            <h2>1. Designated Grievance Officer</h2>
            <p>In accordance with international consumer protection and intermediary guidelines, the details of our appointed Grievance Officer are set out below:</p>
            
            <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0;">
                <h3 style="color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.15rem;">Grievance &amp; Compliance Redressal Cell</h3>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Officer:</strong> Chief Legal &amp; Compliance Officer</p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Product:</strong> Stream Helper &bull; Zonix Media Engine</p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Direct Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:grievance@streamhelper.app">grievance@streamhelper.app</a></p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Legal Inquiries:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@streamhelper.app">legal@streamhelper.app</a></p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>Office Hours:</strong> Monday – Friday, 09:00 AM to 06:00 PM UTC</p>
            </div>

            <h2>2. Grievance Submission Procedure</h2>
            <p>To ensure swift handling, please include the following details in your correspondence:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your full legal name, official entity name (if applicable), and verified email address.</li>
                <li>Clear description of the grievance, technical issue, or legal concern.</li>
                <li>Specific URLs, software version numbers (e.g. v5.5.0), or log snippets associated with the matter.</li>
                <li>Any supporting documentation or evidence necessary to evaluate the claim.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Acknowledgment &amp; Resolution Timelines</h2>
            <p>Our office adheres to the following service level agreements:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Formal Acknowledgment:</strong> Within <strong>24 business hours</strong> of receipt.</li>
                <li><strong>Investigation &amp; Resolution:</strong> Within <strong>15 business days</strong>, during which a detailed written determination will be communicated to the complainant.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
